{"id":44187,"date":"2025-08-29T07:51:31","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T06:51:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=44187"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:41:57","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:41:57","slug":"trail-noturno-valongo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-noturno-valongo\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Noturno de Valongo 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Noturno de Valongo 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Noturno de Valongo 2026<\/strong> (13\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">TNV<\/strong>) realiza-se na noite de s\u00e1bado, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">12 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Largo do Centen\u00e1rio<\/strong> e chegada na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Escola EB 2\/3 Vallis Longus<\/strong>, em <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Valongo<\/strong> (distrito do Porto). Constituindo a 2\u00aa etapa pontu\u00e1vel do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Circuito de Trilhos de Valongo 2026\/2027<\/strong>, o evento est\u00e1 limitado a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">750 participantes<\/strong> e compreende o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Longo de 21 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">19:00<\/strong>, 200 vagas), o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Curto de 13 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">19:30<\/strong>, 300 vagas) e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 9 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">19:35<\/strong>, 250 vagas).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Ao correres \u00e0 luz do frontal pelos trilhos t\u00e9cnicos da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Serra de Quinta Rei<\/strong>, enfrentas a exig\u00eancia aut\u00eantica de uma prova de montanha noturna em pleno inverno nas Serras do Porto. O percurso encontra-se balizado com refletores a cada 20 metros e decorre em regime de semi-autonomia (sem copos nem garrafas pl\u00e1sticas nos abastecimentos), com tempo limite de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">4 horas<\/strong> nos 21 km e barreira hor\u00e1ria interm\u00e9dia no abastecimento do km 8 (\u00e0s 2 horas de prova).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">KeMedo Team Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportos em Natureza<\/strong> e pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Valongo<\/strong>, com o apoio da Junta de Freguesia e dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Valongo, a prova inclui *t-shirt* oficial, seguro desportivo, banhos e o c\u00e9lebre refor\u00e7o final quente do TNV com <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">bifana, caldo verde, cerveja e pastel de nata<\/strong>, al\u00e9m de pr\u00e9mio especial (presunto e caixa de 6 garrafas de vinho) para todas as equipas com mais de 25 atletas inscritos. Explora tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio das melhores <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Meias Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e prepara a tua prova na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo (Pace)<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; le