"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Noturna 9 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 19:35<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase Promo\u00e7\u00e3o (100 vagas):<\/strong> 9,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (12\/08 a 16\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (17\/08 a 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 11,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 30\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o 13\u00ba Trail Noturno de Valongo 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro de 2026, com partidas no Largo do Centen\u00e1rio e meta instalada na Escola EB 2\/3 Vallis Longus, em Valongo. O Trail Longo (21 km) arranca \u00e0s 19:00, o Trail Curto (13 km) \u00e0s 19:30 e a Caminhada (9 km) \u00e0s 19:35.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para as 750 vagas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Fase Promo\u00e7\u00e3o (12 a 16 de agosto, limitada a 100 vagas por dist\u00e2ncia): 14,00 \u20ac (21 km), 12,00 \u20ac (13 km) e 9,00 \u20ac (Caminhada). Na 1\u00aa Fase (17 de agosto a 31 de outubro): 15,00 \u20ac, 13,00 \u20ac e 10,00 \u20ac. Na 2\u00aa Fase (1 a 30 de novembro): 17,00 \u20ac, 15,00 \u20ac e 11,00 \u20ac. M\u00e9dicos, enfermeiros e for\u00e7as policiais sujeitos a escalas podem pedir o pre\u00e7o da 1\u00aa fase at\u00e9 15 de novembro via e-mail (kemedoteam@gmail.com).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio para participar no TNV 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">\u00c9 estritamente obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica e lanterna frontal (sem os quais o atleta \u00e9 impedido de partir), al\u00e9m de recipiente pr\u00f3prio de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o, visto que n\u00e3o existem copos nem garrafas descart\u00e1veis nos abastecimentos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite, barreira hor\u00e1ria e idade m\u00ednima?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite para concluir os 21 km \u00e9 de 4 horas, existindo uma barreira hor\u00e1ria no abastecimento dos 8 km \u00e0s 2 horas de prova. O Trail Longo (21 km) e o Trail Curto (13 km) destinam-se a maiores de 16 anos, enquanto a Caminhada (9 km) \u00e9 aberta a menores acompanhados por um adulto inscrito.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quando funciona o secretariado?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Inclui dorsal com chip, t-shirt oficial (garantida para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 1 m\u00eas antes), seguro, abastecimentos, banhos e o refor\u00e7o final com bifana, caldo verde, cerveja e pastel de nata. O secretariado funciona na Escola EB 2\/3 Vallis Longus na sexta-feira, 11 de dezembro (19:00-22:00), e no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro (10:00-12:30 e 14:00-18:00).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Noturno de Valongo 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Valongo, Porto\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Valongo\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 13\u00ba Trail Noturno de Valongo 2026 realiza-se a 12 de dezembro na Serra de Quinta Rei. Trail 21 km, 13 km e Caminhada 9 km. Consulta hor\u00e1rios e inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-noturno-valongo.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo 21 km (Trail Sprint)\", \"price\": \"14.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trail-noturno-de-valongo-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto 13 km (Mini Trail)\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trail-noturno-de-valongo-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada Noturna 9 km\", \"price\": \"9.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trail-noturno-de-valongo-2026\"}]}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o 13\u00ba Trail Noturno de Valongo 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro de 2026, com partidas no Largo do Centen\u00e1rio e meta instalada na Escola EB 2\/3 Vallis Longus, em Valongo. O Trail Longo (21 km) arranca \u00e0s 19:00, o Trail Curto (13 km) \u00e0s 19:30 e a Caminhada (9 km) \u00e0s 19:35.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para as 750 vagas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na Fase Promo\u00e7\u00e3o (12 a 16 de agosto, limitada a 100 vagas por dist\u00e2ncia): 14,00 \u20ac (21 km), 12,00 \u20ac (13 km) e 9,00 \u20ac (Caminhada). Na 1\u00aa Fase (17 de agosto a 31 de outubro): 15,00 \u20ac, 13,00 \u20ac e 10,00 \u20ac. Na 2\u00aa Fase (1 a 30 de novembro): 17,00 \u20ac, 15,00 \u20ac e 11,00 \u20ac. M\u00e9dicos, enfermeiros e for\u00e7as policiais sujeitos a escalas podem pedir o pre\u00e7o da 1\u00aa fase at\u00e9 15 de novembro via e-mail (kemedoteam@gmail.com).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio para participar no TNV 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\u00c9 estritamente obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica e lanterna frontal (sem os quais o atleta \u00e9 impedido de partir), al\u00e9m de recipiente pr\u00f3prio de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o, visto que n\u00e3o existem copos nem garrafas descart\u00e1veis nos abastecimentos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite, barreira hor\u00e1ria e idade m\u00ednima?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite para concluir os 21 km \u00e9 de 4 horas, existindo uma barreira hor\u00e1ria no abastecimento dos 8 km \u00e0s 2 horas de prova. O Trail Longo (21 km) e o Trail Curto (13 km) destinam-se a maiores de 16 anos, enquanto a Caminhada (9 km) \u00e9 aberta a menores acompanhados por um adulto inscrito.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quando funciona o secretariado?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Inclui dorsal com chip, t-shirt oficial (garantida para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 1 m\u00eas antes), seguro, abastecimentos, banhos e o refor\u00e7o final com bifana, caldo verde, cerveja e pastel de nata. O secretariado funciona na Escola EB 2\/3 Vallis Longus na sexta-feira, 11 de dezembro (19:00-22:00), e no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro (10:00-12:30 e 14:00-18:00).\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70237,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-44187","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-valongo-porto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-noturno-valongo.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/44187","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable